- Expanded MediaPipe control system from two to four servos.
- Successfully mapped right and left shoulders and elbows joint movements to corresponding robotic actuators.
- Conducted power system testing for DC motor integration.
- Diagnosed failure of a buck converter during electrical testing and identified additional wiring and power distribution requirements needed for DC motor operation.

